WEBVTT

00:00:06.146 --> 00:00:07.648
[groans]

00:00:09.733 --> 00:00:11.360
[people clamoring]

00:00:14.071 --> 00:00:15.489
[exhales sharply]

00:00:15.572 --> 00:00:17.241
[explosions]

00:00:18.367 --> 00:00:19.785
Oh, no.

00:00:20.285 --> 00:00:21.286
Val?

00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:23.538
Val! It's all right, it's all right.

00:00:23.705 --> 00:00:26.458
We're a team now. What do you want to do?

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:28.418
We have to save the dragons.

00:00:28.752 --> 00:00:30.963
Aye. You got it! Come on, son.

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.305
[men clamoring]

00:00:50.232 --> 00:00:53.652
[growling]

00:00:53.735 --> 00:00:56.738
Whatever comes, keep hitting the mountain.

00:00:57.364 --> 00:00:59.866
We need to draw the alpha out.

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:06.999
[growls]

00:01:10.002 --> 00:01:11.461
Ready the traps!

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:13.588
[man grunting]

00:01:14.423 --> 00:01:15.674
[growls]

00:01:16.591 --> 00:01:17.718
[growls]

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:26.351
[gasps]

00:01:27.102 --> 00:01:28.353
[Tuffnut] Surprise!

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.980
Yeah! [snickering]

00:01:30.147 --> 00:01:31.273
What?

00:01:31.356 --> 00:01:32.607
Whoa!

00:01:33.525 --> 00:01:35.360
Whoo! Whoo-hoo!

00:01:35.485 --> 00:01:38.280
You really are full of surprises!

00:01:38.363 --> 00:01:39.573
[grunts] Let's go!

00:01:39.656 --> 00:01:42.242
[Tuffnut] Dragon riders, coming through!

00:01:44.369 --> 00:01:45.370
Fire!

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:49.499
[Tuffnut laughing]

00:01:50.959 --> 00:01:51.960
Yeah!

00:01:57.341 --> 00:01:58.967
Cut them down!

00:02:00.385 --> 00:02:01.762
Ah! Whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:02:02.179 --> 00:02:05.057
[Ruffnut] Eret, son of Eret! [screaming]

00:02:15.233 --> 00:02:16.318
[Astrid] Up, girl!

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.071
Lean left, Eret! That's it!

00:02:19.237 --> 00:02:20.614
-[Eret shouts]
-[Astrid] Look out!

00:02:20.697 --> 00:02:22.282
[Eret grunting]

00:02:29.414 --> 00:02:31.249
[Hiccup] Yeah, baby!

00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:36.421
Take them down!

00:02:36.588 --> 00:02:38.256
Heads up!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:39.549
[all grunting]

00:02:40.008 --> 00:02:41.301
[chuckles]

00:02:41.927 --> 00:02:43.345
[wind whistling]

00:02:45.514 --> 00:02:47.182
Dragon master.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.893
Welcome aboard, dragon rider!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.728
Thanks, I think.

00:02:51.895 --> 00:02:53.188
Where have you been?

00:02:53.313 --> 00:02:56.108
Oh, you know, catching up with Mom.

00:02:56.942 --> 00:02:58.026
[gasps]

00:03:04.825 --> 00:03:06.243
[roaring]

00:03:08.036 --> 00:03:09.538
That's your mother?

00:03:09.746 --> 00:03:12.457
Now you know
where I get my dramatic flair.

00:03:17.254 --> 00:03:20.882
The alpha! Now we have a fight!

00:03:21.383 --> 00:03:22.759
[roaring]

00:03:22.926 --> 00:03:24.469
[all screaming]

00:03:26.471 --> 00:03:27.848
[screeching]

00:03:34.646 --> 00:03:36.106
[Hiccup] Come on, Toothless!

00:03:36.273 --> 00:03:38.442
Show them what you got, bud.

00:03:41.778 --> 00:03:43.071
[whooping]

00:03:43.155 --> 00:03:44.281
Atta boy!

00:03:49.494 --> 00:03:50.495
[gasps]

00:03:54.416 --> 00:03:55.917
[grunting]

00:03:56.001 --> 00:03:57.169
[Drago snickering]

00:03:57.252 --> 00:03:59.254
I've waited a long time for this!

00:03:59.337 --> 00:04:01.381
You cannot take our dragons!

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.009
They are controlled by the alpha!

00:04:04.134 --> 00:04:06.928
Then it's a good thing
I brought a challenger.

00:04:07.012 --> 00:04:08.138
[grunts]

00:04:08.722 --> 00:04:10.182
[shouting]

00:04:10.265 --> 00:04:11.808
[chains rattling]

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.779
[growling]

00:04:30.076 --> 00:04:31.369
Another one?

00:04:31.828 --> 00:04:34.706
[Fishlegs] That is a class ten! Class ten!

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.417
[all screaming]

00:04:38.543 --> 00:04:39.544
[Valka] No.

00:04:39.628 --> 00:04:41.588
[Drago] Come on! Take down the alpha!

00:04:41.671 --> 00:04:43.215
-[Valka] No!
-[both grunting]

00:04:48.178 --> 00:04:49.471
[choking]

00:04:50.555 --> 00:04:52.015
[gasps]

00:04:52.432 --> 00:04:53.475
[shouting]

00:04:53.558 --> 00:04:54.559
[Stoick grunting]

00:04:54.684 --> 00:04:55.727
[groans]

00:05:01.233 --> 00:05:02.234
Thank you.

00:05:02.317 --> 00:05:03.568
For you, my dear…

00:05:03.902 --> 00:05:05.403
Anything. [grunts]

00:05:09.199 --> 00:05:11.117
[both roaring]

00:05:13.078 --> 00:05:14.829
Val, do you think you can stop them?

00:05:15.038 --> 00:05:16.206
I'll do my best.

00:05:16.373 --> 00:05:17.582
Come on, Cloudjumper!

00:05:17.791 --> 00:05:18.792
You!

00:05:19.584 --> 00:05:21.586
I watched you burn!

00:05:21.753 --> 00:05:24.256
It takes more
than a little fire to kill me!

00:05:25.048 --> 00:05:26.591
[both grunting]

00:05:38.979 --> 00:05:39.980
[gasps]

00:05:46.528 --> 00:05:47.779
Stoick!

